Subject: [PATCH] wasm: stream attachments through shared encrypted conversion

Feed tar entries and existing account files into the same conversion without creating a transfer tar. Persist attachments one at a time, rename their storage index entries before rewriting the database references, and hash reopened file contents incrementally.
